% Scenario: view settings. The catalog opens the document with its
% bookmarks shown, one column, on page 2 at the viewer's current
% position and zoom; the bookmark gives the outline panel something
% to show.
[ /PageMode /UseOutlines /PageLayout /OneColumn
  /Page 2 /View [/XYZ null null null] /DOCVIEW pdfmark
[ /Title (Second page) /Page 2 /OUT pdfmark
72 700 moveto 300 700 lineto stroke
showpage
72 600 moveto 300 600 lineto stroke
showpage
